  - **HoH**: **+1–3pp F1** (drift-dominated; validates drift-probe, not multi-axis)
- Includes statistical plan (McNemar's test, bootstrap CIs) and a **negative-result commitment**: if multi-axis advantage <3pp, we pivot to "when does multi-axis gating help?"

